,"messageBody":"","fileTypesAndContributionMap":{"md":{"insertions":691,"deletions":0}}},{"hash":"5c2841f4fcb16fc3fb96b9db564bd70e0fba4788","isMergeCommit":false,"messageTitle":"Update AGENTS.md to direct AI Agent to JAVA_CODING_STANDARD.md","messageBody":"","fileTypesAndContributionMap":{"md":{"insertions":4,"deletions":0}}},{"hash":"04da8c09931e3eccc3d800430dd9c6a52c095735","isMergeCommit":false,"messageTitle":"Refactor Bert.java into a package","messageBody":"","fileTypesAndContributionMap":{"gradle":{"insertions":1,"deletions":1},"java":{"insertions":3,"deletions":1}}},{"hash":"3fa718cb73f2a1ace04e434869c304d371c2bc82","isMergeCommit":false,"messageTitle":"Add GIT_CONVENTIONS.md for AI Agents","messageBody":"","fileTypesAndContributionMap":{"md":{"insertions":1,"deletions":0}}},{"hash":"baf88e923087a6bc0de074867594548406c07f88","isMergeCommit":false,"messageTitle":"Format lines exceeding 120 character limit","messageBody":"Several lines across CommandParser, DateTimeParser, and Storage exceed\nthe hard limit of 120 characters.\n\nLines exceeding 120 characters hinder readability on narrow screens and\nsplit-view editors, violating the project coding standards.\n\nLet\u0027s,\n* wrap long exception messages and method calls in CommandParser,\n  DateTimeParser, and Storage\n* format Javadoc description lines in DateTimeParser to fit within\n  the line length limit\n","fileTypesAndContributionMap":{"java":{"insertions":10,"deletions":7}}},{"hash":"0b11445230063ba67e6ca9717ca05f64e0006346","isMergeCommit":false,"messageTitle":"Fix indentation and wrapped line continuation indents","messageBody":"Javadoc comment in InvalidIndexException uses 3 spaces of indentation,\nand wrapped elements in DateTimeParser use 4-space instead of 8-space\ncontinuation indentation.\n\nNon-standard indentation impairs visual hierarchy and violates the\nproject\u0027s 4-space basic and 8-space continuation indentation rules.\n\nLet\u0027s,\n* adjust Javadoc indentation in InvalidIndexException to 4 spaces\n* update wrapped line indentation in DateTimeParser to 8 spaces\n  relative to parent lines\n","fileTypesAndContributionMap":{"java":{"insertions":12,"deletions":12}}},{"hash":"ba2158568076329dc7e6f866dcc4446c3d7f440a","isMergeCommit":false,"messageTitle":"Fix ternary colon spacing and remove trailing whitespace","messageBody":"Ternary operator in Todo.java is missing whitespace before the colon,\nand the ASCII banner in Ui.java contains trailing whitespace.\n\nInconsistent spacing reduces code cleanliness and violates the Java\ncoding standard.\n\nLet\u0027s,\n* add space before the colon in Todo\u0027s toString ternary expression\n* strip trailing whitespace characters from Ui.java\n","fileTypesAndContributionMap":{"java":{"insertions":4,"deletions":4}}},{"hash":"455ddd608f84fc838140ee5b8846ff223c843a73","isMergeCommit":false,"messageTitle":"Standardize boolean task completion variable names and types","messageBody":"Task completion flag is named isMark and typed as boxed Boolean\nin constructors across task classes.\n\nVariable and parameter names representing boolean states should sound\nlike booleans (such as isMarked), and primitive boolean avoids\nunnecessary object boxing and nullability concerns.\n\nLet\u0027s,\n* rename isMark to isMarked across Todo, Deadline, Event, and Storage\n* use primitive boolean instead of boxed Boolean in task constructors\n","fileTypesAndContributionMap":{"java":{"insertions":21,"deletions":20}}},{"hash":"18a7f1c37d9eb79a725a990680a9af46e7b2baa0","isMergeCommit":false,"messageTitle":"Update Javadoc comments for public methods and constructors","messageBody":"Bert.java has an unused @param args tag on run() and missing constructor\nJavadocs, while Todo.java lacks Javadoc on toFileFormat().\n\nAccurate and complete Javadoc comments ensure all public APIs are well\ndocumented and free of phantom parameters.\n\nLet\u0027s,\n* remove the invalid @param args tag from Bert#run()\n* add Javadoc header comments for Bert constructor and main method\n* add Javadoc header comment for Todo#toFileFormat()\n","fileTypesAndContributionMap":{"java":{"insertions":15,"deletions":2}}},{"hash":"24cfd9628178be80b90afd40827c579ac61f999a","isMergeCommit":false,"messageTitle":"Standardize import statement ordering across all classes","messageBody":"Import statements across multiple classes are inconsistently ordered,\nwith project imports placed before standard java.* imports.\n\nA consistent ordering of imports makes it easier to browse class\ndependencies and conforms to project conventions.\n\nLet\u0027s organize imports consistently by placing standard Java library\npackages first, followed by project package imports.\n","fileTypesAndContributionMap":{"java":{"insertions":20,"deletions":16}}},{"hash":"63720dfa04ce2e81babd41419f7c8d57fa5d8c38","isMergeCommit":false,"messageTitle":"CommandParser.java: add newline to if-statement exceeding 120 char","messageBody":"","fileTypesAndContributionMap":{"java":{"insertions":2,"deletions":1}}},{"hash":"7520804429db8ec09d098e73294eef9079af40b6","isMergeCommit":true,"messageTitle":"Merge pull request #3 from Chia-Kei-Pei/styling-cleanup","messageBody":"Styling cleanup. Follow Java Coding Standards from CS2103","fileTypesAndContributionMap":{}},{"hash":"e6cd73bacfc750c34de99ef559f42a89fb0bd9a3","isMergeCommit":false,"messageTitle":"Add GIT_CONVENTIONS.md for AI Agents","messageBody":"","tags":["A-JavaDoc","A-CodingStandard"],"fileTypesAndContributionMap":{"md":{"insertions":127,"deletions":0}}},{"hash":"90129856d24387f7c7e14414dea8c0d8d6b28eb8","isMergeCommit":false,"messageTitle":"Move all java files into \"bert\" package","messageBody":"","fileTypesAndContributionMap":{"java":{"insertions":40,"deletions":40}}},{"hash":"0a9213be832c3397855ef908d73e57f40449411c","isMergeCommit":false,"messageTitle":"Add my first junit test file","messageBody":"","fileTypesAndContributionMap":{"java":{"insertions":17,"deletions":0}}},{"hash":"88ef345a603a92d3cf622352377223